This scenario adapts Manias E, Geddes F, Watson B, Jones D, Della P (2015), "Communication failures during clinical
handovers lead to a poor patient outcome: Lessons from a case report", SAGE Open Medical Case Reports,
doi:10.1177/2050313X15584859 (CC BY-NC), which allows non-commercial use only. It is one of the ten scenarios of the
non-commercial subset (`"nc": true` in benchmark/index.json); the rest of the benchmark's text is CC BY 4.0
(LICENSE-DATA) and the code is MIT (LICENSE). The leaderboard includes these ten scenarios, so a commercial use of the
benchmark has to leave them out, and its scores are then not comparable with the leaderboard.

Changes: the source was adapted into a benchmark scenario; source.md gives the citation, the quoted passages and what
was adapted. The source's authors do not endorse this benchmark.
